  "description": "Enhance Kentico Xperience development efforts with a fluent, intuitive API designed for efficient content querying. XperienceCommunity.DataContext simplifies the process of building queries against Kentico’s ContentItemQueryBuilder by abstracting its complexity behind a fluent, strongly-typed interface. Built on .NET 8 and fully integrated with Xperience by Kentico, this library improves productivity during local development and testing, allowing teams to streamline content management operations and accelerate project delivery.",
